        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946220/extras/22e8c73e7b2d47f343bce5bc8fbadca6.avif?t=1756452901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946220/extras_big/22e8c73e7b2d47f343bce5bc8fbadca6.webp?t=1756452901 width=1600 height=1600 /></span><strong>This is a short horror visual novel inspired by <i><u>true events</u></i> I've experienced,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946220/extras/56d7bd5c3afb6338962f59c8be293f9c.avif?t=1756452901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946220/extras_big/56d7bd5c3afb6338962f59c8be293f9c.avif?t=1756452901 width=1600 height=1200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Purple Maniac you play as a father with his baby in a bathroom stall. Then a murderer and his latest victim enter the restroom. You have to keep your baby quiet while you hear the slaughter coming from right beside you. Do you cover your baby's ears to the sound of a power drill or rock them to sleep?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946220/extras/22e8c73e7b2d47f343bce5bc8fbadca6.avif?t=1756452901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946220/extras_big/22e8c73e7b2d47f343bce5bc8fbadca6.webp?t=1756452901 width=1600 height=1600 /></span><strong>This is a short horror visual novel inspired by <i><u>true events</u></i> I've experienced,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946220/extras/56d7bd5c3afb6338962f59c8be293f9c.avif?t=1756452901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946220/extras_big/56d7bd5c3afb6338962f59c8be293f9c.avif?t=1756452901 width=1600 height=1200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Purple Maniac you play as a father with his baby in a bathroom stall. Then a murderer and his latest victim enter the restroom. You have to keep your baby quiet while you hear the slaughter coming from right beside you. Do you cover your baby's ears to the sound of a power drill or rock them to sleep?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
